mindmap
  root((Autonomy Tiers))
    Observe
      Log only
      Zero execution
      Blast radius 0
    Recommend
      Analyst decision
      Dashboard prompt
      Blast radius any
    Auto-Safe
      Low blast actions
      Immediate execution
      Risk threshold < 40%
    Auto-Veto
      Medium blast actions
      5m Grace period
      Risk threshold < 75%
    Human-Required
      Critical actions
      Explicit MFA/Auth
      Risk threshold > 75%